\tr{\td{the two runs that hit the limit}\td{two \code{CHANGE_LITERAL} mutants of the bugs corpus (a literal 1 replaced by 2^64 - 1 and by 2^64) that take 22 to 26 s alone on a measurement core, in the base as in the candidate; on the busy efficiency cores they passed 60 s, as they did in the gates of the other agents' distributions that hour (1 and 2 such runs). Alone, with the gate's own command, base and candidate reject both, as the official checker does, through the executable and through the jars. The bugs corpus through the candidate executable a second time: SOUNDNESS 0, COMPLETENESS 0, agree 2,590, declined 102, no error: with it the totals are the release's, agree 15,741, declined 2,034}}
